WEBVTT

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:55.820
These days, I don't know where I've come from

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:05.000
I've forgotten the ways of love 'cause it's been a while

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.800
For us, life is five minutes' introspection

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:15.930
You're real pushy, but when your jewel is taken away,

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:18.180
your beauty is touched by sadness

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:26.270
Sometimes we send tears flying with a wild sha-la-lu-la

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:31.900
Then we look at the shooting stars, it's simple

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.940
We're all human

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:38.990
Viva tears, just shed them, baby

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:41.490
They're not wasted

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:46.410
Can't stop, I love you like this

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:50.000
Those tears, tears, yeah

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.960
Can you give those tears to me?

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.590
When you fall, get right back up again

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:01.390
Let's go together! Tell me "This is great" again

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:05.220
Tears, tears, goodbye!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:51.810
<b>Go With the Flow, Baby{living by flowing and being made to flow}</b>

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:51.810
