00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:35.040
<b>Gogol Imperial Space Force</b>

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:39.880
<b>Jaicro Imperial Space Force</b>

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:32.240
<b>Hey, Everett</b>

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:36.290
<b>What am I {like }in your world?</b>

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:39.000
<b>Let me take a look</b>

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:40.380
<b>Hey, Everett</b>

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:44.170
<b>According to you, there are lots of different worlds</b>

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:47.170
<b>I'm not sure I understand</b>

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:49.130
<b>"Hi, Dandy"</b>

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:51.050
<b>"Hello"</b>

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:53.140
<b>"How are you doing?"</b>

00:22:54.390 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>Hey, Ph.D.</b>

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:59.980
<b>Your alternate worlds will always overlap and never interfere</b>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.730
<b>That blows my mind</b>

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:08.360
<b>Things get harder when they cool</b>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:12.820
<b>Things melt when they're heated</b>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:15.120
<b>This world is so full of rules,</b>

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:18.710
<b>it's going to drive me crazy</b>

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:23.080
<b>One dimension, two dimensions, three dimensions</b>

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:26.960
<b>A supernova is spreading from west to east</b>

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.670
<b>Easy game, easy game,</b>

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:31.220
<b>too easy game</b>

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:35.680
<b>The way there is fine, but what about coming back?</b>

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:40.600
<b>A dream of a never-ending dream</b>

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:44.940
<b>A wonderful, milky kiss</b>

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:52.030
<b>Will this universe expand forever?</b>

